⭐

52
00:03:18,142 --> 00:03:22,918
(Q29) Okay, what about Indigenous Women's lives. That sounds appropriate.

53
00:03:22,918 --> 00:03:36,487
[Q29答案句： might do. 本来想选，但改主意了➡️不要只看xxx，问过之后再想一下➡️ 好吧（同意的是什么？ 是 问过之后再做决定，所以是有可能might）] Paul：I thought so too, but I looked at last year's exam questions and that changed my mind.女生：Don't judge the value of the course on that. Maybe, talk to some other students first and we can talk about it again later.Paul： Okay.

54
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
⭐

55
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
好的。

56
00:03:36,487 --> 00:03:40,928
(Q30) Yes. And lastly, will you sign up for Portuguese lessons?

57
00:03:40,928 --> 00:03:44,312
My Spanish is good, so would I find that module easy?

58
00:03:44,312 --> 00:03:53,974
Not necessarily. Some people find that Spanish interferes with learning Portuguese...getting the accent right too.It's quite different in a lot of ways.

59
00:03:53,974 --> 00:03:56,415
[Q30答案句： 宁愿做别的， 表示拒绝， won't do] Well,I'd much sooner do something else, then.

60
00:03:56,415 --> 00:03:58,915
Alright. Now, what we need to do is...

